license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Experiment scripts, result files and figure sources reproducing every number in
  "Period-Aware Video Transformers for Risk-Controlled Measurement of Periodic
  Structures". Includes the synthetic benchmark, the 33-video escalator inventory,
  the CUHK Avenue anomaly evaluation, and the clustered statistics used in the paper.
  All runs on a single CPU workstation.
keywords:
  - periodic structures
  - harmonic ambiguity
  - phase correlation
  - selective prediction
  - video anomaly detection
  - escalator inspection
